        and eL.i["Base.ElectricWire"] == 2 and eM ~= nil and eM.s == "kl_01_1" and inst.built["144,143,0,kl_01_0"] == nil
        and inst.lamps.next > math.max(L.keyId, M.keyId),
        "蓋燈：發編號寫進 keyId，帳本照編號記位置、蓋的圖與退料（不寫 built）；同一格兩盞各一個編號")

